Microsoft’s side of the same renegotiation

@mustafasuleyman: “we renegotiated the contract with OpenAI and that freed us up to go and pursue the absolute frontier.” Superintelligence team is 12 months old. Compute isn’t a bottleneck right now. And they’re still running OpenAI + Anthropic + others in foundry.

OpenAI gets multi-cloud. Microsoft gets room to build. Both freer.
